    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.2",
      "title": "Aventails description",
      "body": "Aventails can be:\n● Chainmail Aventail: Aventails made from chainmail elements, attached to the helmet with a suspension system.\n● Scales Aventail: Aventails made of metal scales riveted to the pelerine.\n● Fabric Aventail: Aventails made from fabric, used to display heraldry and must be decorated.",
