    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.3",
      "title": "General Requirements",
      "body": "All types of aventails must respect the following requirements :\n● Must be based on historical sources.\n● Must be firmly attached to the helmet with a vervelle and leather system.\n● Must be appropriately sized for the wearer, as depicted in historical sources.\n● It is not allowed to combine two or more different types of aventails (e.g., chainmail and fabric) unless documented by historical sources.\n\nEach helmet-related document will explain what types of aventail are allowed and denied.",
