    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "2.2",
      "title": "Specific Requirements",
      "body": "● The outer edge of the chainmail aventail must be securely stitched to a padded pelerine to prevent displacement.\n● The aventail must cover the shoulders, throat, and neck at all times without gaps.\n● Chainmail aventails must be properly maintained: damaged rings must be replaced, rust must be removed, etc.\n● Chainmail Aventails must follow the general requirements (1.3)",
