    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "3.2",
      "title": "Specific Requirements",
      "body": "● Scales must be contoured (not flat) and securely riveted to the pelerine for a proper fit and protection.\n● Allowed shapes include square, triangular, and semicircular designs.\n● Scales must lay evenly and overlap slightly to ensure full protection with no gaps.\n● Scales Aventails must follow the general requirements (1.3)",
