    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.2",
      "title": "Specific Requirements",
      "body": "● Fabric aventails must consist of at least one layer of fabric, attached to the helmet using the same suspension method as other aventails (see 6.).\n● Fabric aventail must conform to the Textiles and Leather document.\n● Fabric aventails must follow the general requirements (1.3)\n\nFabric aventails must include at least one of the approved decoration methods, such as:\n● Multi-color base (at least 2 distinct colors)\n● Embroidery\n● Stitching\n● Stamp-printing\n● Decorations must be inspired by medieval images and not be offensive.\n● Any additional plates must be concealed when standing.\n● It is recommended to sew the fabric aventail to the pelerine.",
      "page_from": 11,
